  "description": "<div>\r\n<p>&bull; Brand introduction:<br>Qrafted World is a passionate brand dedicated to providing travelers with unique and memorable keepsakes. Our handmade custom keychains are crafted with care and designed to inspire wanderlust in every traveler.</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Product description:<br>Our keychains are made from high-quality materials, eco-friendly and feature personalized elements tailored to each customer. These one-of-a-kind keychains cater to travel enthusiasts, making for perfect gifts, souvenirs, or travel mementos.</p>\r\n<p>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):<br>Our Keychains are personalized for each customer. Keychains are travel themed (Passport stamps) and then the customer adds the countries visited in the form of rings/tokens. They are unique, eco-friendly (made of natural cork) and stylish. Everyone loves them!</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Payment terms:<br>Affiliates will earn a competitive commission on each successful sale they generate. Commissions are paid on a monthly basis via the UpPromote platform.</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Other information:<br>By joining the Qrafted World Affiliate Program, you'll have the opportunity to join a high profit business. The number of affiliates will be limited and the higher commission will only be kept for older affiliates. This is a new product with a high conversion rate. Individual products are low value but note that a keychain is always purchased with multiple rings and average order value is USD 40/50</p>\r\n</div>",
